<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#F5F1E8', padding: '24px 72px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 104, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 3, height: 34, background: '#A8402F' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                断网，还是同一个人的声音
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.5, marginTop: 8, letterSpacing: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                讲解员的音色一变，游客立刻会觉得「换人了」
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 508, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(43,74,69,0.07)', padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#2B4A45' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                        命中：直接播本地文件
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    六个展项的讲解稿、深讲、问答，以及演示时会说的句子，都提前用同一位发音人合成好，跟程序一起打包。断网时命中的是本地音频，实测 2 ms 出声。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(168,64,47,0.07)', padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#A8402F' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                        未命中：只上字幕，不换嗓子
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    断网、又没预录过的新句子，打开严格离线开关（QX_TTS_OFFLINE_STRICT=1）后只显示文字、不发声。宁可安静，也不换成另一种音色。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(43,74,69,0.07)', padding: '20px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2A2E', fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                    赛前只做一件事
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    联网跑一遍 <Text style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8402F', fontFamily: "'Consolas', monospace" }}>--bake-voices</Text>，程序会把当天要演示的问答逐条合成并写进语音包，重新打包即可。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#A8402F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: "'Source Han Serif SC', 'SimSun', serif" }}>
                宁可少说一句，也不让讲解员突然变声。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#2B4A45', padding: '38px 32px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                已随程序打包的语音
            </Text>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, color: '#F5F1E8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    64
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.7, marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.75, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                    条音频，25 MB
                    <br />
                    跟着 exe 一起走，不占安装步骤
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 3, background: '#A8402F' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F5F1E8', opacity: 0.5, lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
                其中包括 3 条降级话术：识图失败、模型不可用这类兜底，也用小侨的声音。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            侨乡 · 江门 AI 智能讲解员
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1F2A2E', opacity: 0.4, fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>
            07 / 14
        </Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
